        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 16, \"total_count\": 16, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Home page lists 6 restaurants with cuisine and price ($$). Clicking \\\"The Golden Fork\\\" opens /restaurant/1 detail page showing cuisine (French), price ($$$$), address, rating, description, amenities, and reviews.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"Sakura\\\" into search box; list filtered live to show only \\\"Sakura Garden\\\" (1 restaurant available). Clearing the field restored full list of 6 restaurants.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /restaurant/1, selected date Sep 3 2026, time 19:00, party size 6, filled name/email/phone, applied coupon, clicked Confirm Reservation. Got \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" toast and confirmation panel with \\\"View My Reservations\\\" link; reservation appears in /reservations Upcoming list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/reservations page shows Upcoming/Past tabs. Reservation was listed under Upcoming with Modify/Cancel buttons; after cancelling, it moved to Past (1) tab with status \\\"Cancelled\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /restaurant/2, \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab: selected 4-star rating, filled Name/Date of Visit/Review text, submitted. Got \\\"Review Submitted!\\\" toast; restaurant rating updated (5.0→4.5) and review count increased (1→2); new review correctly appears under \\\"Sakura Garden\\\" Reviews tab with entered name, date, rating stars, and text.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entered coupon code GROUP15 (valid for 6+ guests) with party size 6, clicked Apply, got \\\"Coupon Applied! 15% off for parties of 6 or more\\\" notification; coupon chip \\\"GROUP15 - 15% off\\\" shown in form; reservation record afterward shows \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"In the reservation date picker (today = Sep 2, 2026), all past dates and today itself (Aug 30, 31, Sep 1, 2) are shown as disabled gridcells; the earliest selectable date is Sep 3, 2026, preventing booking of past dates/times.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked Modify on existing reservation, changed time from 19:00 to 20:00 and party size from 6 to 4 Guests, clicked Save Changes. Got \\\"Reservation Updated - Your reservation has been modified successfully\\\" toast, and the reservation card now correctly shows 20:00 and 4 Guests.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search box is a live-filter field with no separate submit action; with empty text it simply displays the default full restaurant list (6 restaurants) rather than performing/triggering any filtered search action.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate review not prevented\", \"actual\": \"Submitted a second review for the same restaurant using the identical reviewer name and identical Date of Visit as the first review. The system accepted it without any warning/blocking: toast said \\\"Review Submitted!\\\" again, review count went from 2 to 3, and rating recalculated (4.5→4.3). No constraint prevents leaving multiple comments tied to the same order/visit.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon rule not re-validated after reservation modification\", \"actual\": \"Applying an invalid/inapplicable coupon is correctly blocked at apply-time (e.g. GROUP15 with party size 2 → \\\"Coupon Not Applicable: This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\"; unknown code → \\\"Invalid Coupon\\\"), and only one coupon can be attached at a time (UI replaces the input with a single applied-coupon chip, no way to add a second). However, in an earlier test, a reservation was created with GROUP15 (6 guests, rule: 6+ guests only), then modified down to 4 guests via \\\"Modify\\\" - the system kept \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\" on the booking without removing it or re-validating that the party size no longer qualifies, violating \\\"coupons must comply with applicable rules\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Restaurant detail pages (e.g. /restaurant/1, /restaurant/3) display average price ($$$$/$$/etc.), address, description, and amenities as plain read-only text with no edit controls, inputs, or admin affordances visible to the end user. Party Size selector on the reservation form is capped at a maximum of 10 Guests (options 1-10 only), preventing booking beyond a fixed per-table capacity.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No real-time monetary discounted price/total is calculated or displayed\", \"actual\": \"After selecting date/time/party size and applying a coupon, the UI only shows a discount label (e.g. \\\"GROUP15 - 15% off\\\") with no base price, subtotal, or computed total price anywhere on the reservation form, confirmation toast, or reservations list. Restaurants only expose a qualitative price tier ($, $$, $$$, $$$$), so no numeric price is ever calculated in real time as the requirement describes. Submitting does correctly validate info and return a booking result (\\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\"), but the discounted-price-calculation portion of this requirement is not implemented.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked \\\"Modify\\\" on booking, dialog opened to re-select New Time/Party Size, saved and got success toast with updated info. Clicked \\\"Cancel\\\" and an alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" appeared with Keep/Cancel Reservation options; confirming cancelled the booking with a toast and moved it to Past/Cancelled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No message/notification center for historical notifications\", \"actual\": \"Real-time toast popups do appear when booking status changes (e.g. \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\", \\\"Reservation Updated\\\", \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\", \\\"Coupon Applied!\\\"), satisfying the real-time popup portion. However, there is no message center or notification history feature anywhere in the app - the header only contains \\\"TableSpot\\\", \\\"Restaurants\\\", and \\\"My Reservations\\\" links; no bell/notifications icon or history page exists to review past notifications after the toast disappears.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No comment/review history visible in personal center\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"My Reservations\\\" page (personal center) shows Upcoming and Past reservations (applications/completed orders) correctly, e.g. cancelled booking appeared under Past with status \\\"Cancelled\\\". However, there is no section anywhere in \\\"My Reservations\\\" or elsewhere showing the user's own submitted reviews/comment history - reviews written (e.g. on Sakura Garden) are only visible on the individual restaurant's page, not aggregated in a personal center view.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
